{"symbol":"CNINFOTECH","yahoo":"CNINFOTECH.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"CapitalNumbers Infotech Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://www.capitalnumbers.com","about":"CapitalNumbers Infotech Limited provides digital consulting, information technology engineering, and software development solutions to enterprises and startups worldwide. The company offers digital engineering services, such as custom web and mobile app development, api development and integration, platform modernization and reengineering, product engineering and MVP development, and maintenance and support; data analytics and engineering; artificial intelligence (AI), generative AI, and machine learning; cloud engineering; e-commerce development and staff augmentation services; salesforce development; quality assurance; and user-interface and user experience design services, as well as blockchain and augmented reality and virtual reality services. It serves healthcare, banking and financial services, real estate, automotive, entertainment, energy, sports, manufacturing sectors, logistics, retail, travel, education, and agriculture industries. CapitalNumbers Infotech Limited was incorporated in 2012 and is headquartered in Kolkata, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:38:35+00:00","quote":{"price":76.11,"prevClose":77.2,"marketCap":185.91,"high52":126.95,"low52":70.0,"pe":7.29,"bookValue":78.42,"dividendRate":2.0,"roe":14.64,"shares":2.4427,"insiders":79.62,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-01-27","2025-01-28","2025-01-29","2025-01-30","2025-01-31","2025-02-03","2025-02-04","2025-02-05","2025-02-06","2025-02-07","2025-02-10","2025-02-11","2025-02-12","2025-02-13","2025-02-14","2025-02-17","2025-02-18","2025-02-19","2025-02-20","2025-02-21","2025-02-24","2025-02-25","2025-02-27","2025-02-28","2025-03-03","2025-03-04","2025-03-05","2025-03-06","2025-03-07","2025-03-10","2025-03-11","2025-03-12","2025-03-13","2025-03-17","202